WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.432
Welcome to Module 5. We will add dictionaries and sets to our Python toolkit.

00:00:05.432 --> 00:00:12.582
Dictionaries store labeled information using key-value pairs, while sets help us work with unique values,

00:00:12.582 --> 00:00:17.012
membership, and overlap. A set stores unique values.

00:00:17.012 --> 00:00:23.198
It is useful for distinct categories, membership tests, and comparing overlap between groups.
